  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-28T15:36:31.967Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Certain avatars (including the Rexouium and Canis Woof by Rezillo Ryker) have gestures that utilize gesture-weight, typically bound to trigger pull depth while making a fist gesture. Although this is still working normally when both hands are available, it no longer works when the Action Menu is open on the opposite hand - the fist gesture is detected, but pulling the trigger has no effect. This has made it impossible to perform certain gestures with one hand while e.g. controlling a puppet with the other. It has also made it impossible to lock said gestures in place by using the Action Menu to disable gestures.",
